  [linux64] reaper_datasource.so https://github.com/TeamAudio/reaper-datasource/releases/download/v0.1.0/reaper_datasource.so
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_datasource.dylib https://github.com/TeamAudio/reaper-datasource/releases/download/v0.1.0/reaper_datasource.dylib
